OpenClash itself, its mihomo core, subscriptions and rule data are not included.
Only dependencies available from the official OpenWrt feeds are selected; see
docs/openclash.md for upstream links and the runtime installation boundary.

The package Makefiles under packages/ describe future SDK packages, but the
current Buildroot pipeline does not compile or install them as APKs. Their
`root/` trees are copied explicitly as named `*-overlay` components, are loaded
by LuCI at runtime, and are represented in CUSTOM-COMPONENTS.manifest, the
release manifest, NOTICE and augmented CycloneDX SBOM. This naming avoids a
false claim that locally built APKs were produced.
